    Bug 1912424 - Hide unavailable Developer Tools menu items. r=tobyp

    Hide the Developer Tools app menu item and the Developer Toolbox main menu item
    when required DevTools preferences are disabled.

    Also hide the app menu item when Developer Tools are disabled by enterprise
    policy (fixes aregression from bug 1786421).

    Add coverage for preference changes and policy handling.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320443

